OL,3,GNEWSAResidents flooded after quarry
OL,4,Aexplosion told blast work to resume
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents who were evacuated after a
OL,7,Fquarry blast forced dirty, brown water
OL,8,Fdown a mountainside and flooded their
OL,9,Fhomes are anxious it will happen again.
OL,11,FThirteen homes on Heol Berry in
OL,12,FGwaelod-y-Garth, Cardiff, were hit when
OL,13,Fwater from an old iron mine workings
OL,14,Fwas displaced by the planned blast.
OL,16,FKevin Duncan, part of a local campaign
OL,17,Fgroup, said he had been told blasting
OL,18,Fwould resume at the site, albeit a
OL,19,Fdistance away from the mine workings.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
